    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what? I'm not sure I follow the goblin metaphor. Can you please ignore the fantasy stuff and just focus on the legal side? Specifically, if I'm a solo freelancer with no business entity, how \"big\" can these \"losses\" actually get if I'm personally on the hook for legal fees and damages?",
